        "text": "The Ukrainian General Staff reported on May 16 that Ukrainian forces struck a Russian personnel concentration near Yalta (south of Novopavlivka and roughly five kilometers from the frontline) on May 15 or overnight on May 15 to 16.[35] Russian forces continued limited ground assaults in the Oleksandrivka direction on May 16 but did not advance, as Ukrainian forces reportedly counterattacked in the area.",
